# Repo-root .gitignore.
#
# The project sources live under backend/. The backend/.gitignore handles
# Python build artifacts, IDE noise, and corpus-level exclusions. This root file exists because
# the virtualenv was created at the repo root (not inside backend/), and
# patterns in backend/.gitignore only match files reachable from backend/.
#
# Add patterns here when they need to apply above backend/ (such as the
# virtualenv that lives one level up from the sources).

# --- Virtualenv created in this directory ---
.venv/

# --- Local tooling state ---
.codegraph/
.archify/
run_streamlit_ui_command.txt

# --- Stray launcher artifacts from PowerShell mishaps ---
.venvScriptspython.exe
*PYTHONPATH
docs/*
